<div class="gl-page"><section class="gl-hero"><div class="gl-wrap gl-herogrid"><div class="gl-heromain"><div class="gl-cat">70 terms &middot; CA-reviewed definitions</div><h1 class="gl-h1">Stock Audit Glossary</h1><p class="glh2-lead">Seventy terms used in stock audit, fixed asset verification and outlet audit work, each defined once and applied to the situation it belongs to.</p><div class="glh2-search"><span class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg></span><input id="glh2-search" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Search 70 stock audit terms - try &lsquo;drawing power&rsquo;, &lsquo;cut-off&rsquo;&hellip;"></div><div class="gl-herobadges"><span class="gl-hb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>Defined once, applied on the pages that use it</span><span class="gl-hb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>CA &amp; CS reviewed</span><span class="gl-hb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>Lender and CARO 2020 context</span><span class="gl-hb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>Free to use</span></div><div class="gl-popular"><span class="gl-popular__l">Popular</span><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/cut-off-procedure">Cut-Off Procedure</a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/sma-classification">SMA Classification</a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/npa-classification">NPA Classification</a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/book-debt">Book Debt</a></div></div><aside class="gl-herocta"><div class="gl-cta-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg></div><h3>Prefer a CA to run the count?</h3><p>Independent stock audits, fixed asset verification and outlet audits across nine cities.</p><a class="gl-herocta__btn" href="/stock-audit">Stock audit services &rarr;</a><div class="gl-herocta__trust"><span class="star">&#9733;</span> 4.9 on Google &middot; UDIN on every report</div></aside></div></section><div class="glh2-filterbar"><div class="gl-wrap glh2-filters"><button class="glh2-fpill is-active" data-cat="all">All terms <span class="c">70</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="lending">The Lending Trigger <span class="c">7</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="count">The Count <span class="c">8</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="valuation">Valuation and Provisioning <span class="c">5</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="evidence">Records and Evidence <span class="c">6</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="ownership">Stock That Is Not Yours <span class="c">5</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="assets">Fixed Assets and Tagging <span class="c">9</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="mystery">Mystery Audit <span class="c">4</span></button><button class="glh2-fpill" data-cat="sector">Sector Vocabulary <span class="c">26</span></button></div></div><div class="glh2-body"><div class="gl-wrap"><section class="glh2-group" data-group="lending"><div class="glh2-group__head"><h2>The Lending Trigger</h2><span class="c"><span class="glh2-livecount">7</span> terms</span></div><p class="glh2-blurb">Why a verification is commissioned at all: the account grading, the security, the facility and the returns filed against it.</p><div class="glh2-grid"><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/book-debt" class="glh2-card" data-term="book debt"><span class="glh2-card__t">Book Debt</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/cash-credit-limit" class="glh2-card" data-term="cash credit limit"><span class="glh2-card__t">Cash Credit Limit</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/consortium-banking" class="glh2-card" data-term="consortium banking"><span class="glh2-card__t">Consortium Banking</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/npa-classification" class="glh2-card" data-term="npa classification"><span class="glh2-card__t">NPA Classification</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/primary-security" class="glh2-card" data-term="primary security"><span class="glh2-card__t">Primary Security</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/qis-statement" class="glh2-card" data-term="qis statement"><span class="glh2-card__t">QIS Statement</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/sma-classification" class="glh2-card" data-term="sma classification"><span class="glh2-card__t">SMA Classification</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a></div></section><section class="glh2-group" data-group="count"><div class="glh2-group__head"><h2>The Count</h2><span class="c"><span class="glh2-livecount">8</span> terms</span></div><p class="glh2-blurb">The mechanics of counting, from cut-off through to tag control and what a negative balance means.</p><div class="glh2-grid"><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/count-tag-control" class="glh2-card" data-term="count tag control"><span class="glh2-card__t">Count Tag Control</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition &rarr;</span></a><a href="/glossary/stock-audit/cut-off-procedure" class="glh2-card" data-term="cut-off procedure"><span class="glh2-card__t">Cut-Off Procedure</span><span class="glh2-card__v">View definition